      "writtenOn": "2023-03-31T19:37:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it should be fine in this limited case at least. The files created by this command are not used directly as inputs by Ninja.\n\nFurthermore, they are either files created in a temporary directory used to create a zip file and then deleted, or files in a directory that is only intended to be used once the build is finished (so the files would have been updated either way).",
